BEGIN_HYPERDESC
<h1>The floating base on Venus</h1>
Aphrodite (Utils/BaseKit/offworld.py aerostat) floats 55 km up; its deck
is the ground for vessels over it. A delta-glider landed on pad 1 must
stay there; another hops off pad 2 on its hover engines and must come
down on the deck again, not fall through it.
END_HYPERDESC

BEGIN_ENVIRONMENT
  System Sol
  Date MJD 51983.25
  Script Tests/AerostatTest
END_ENVIRONMENT

BEGIN_FOCUS
  Ship A1
END_FOCUS

BEGIN_CAMERA
  TARGET A1
  MODE Extern
  POS 4.0 -20.0 -30
  TRACKMODE TargetRelative
  FOV 50.00
END_CAMERA

BEGIN_SHIPS
A1:DeltaGlider
  STATUS Landed Venus
  BASE Aphrodite:1
  HEADING 0.00
  GEAR 1 1.0000
  PRPLEVEL 0:0.050 1:1.000
END
A2:DeltaGlider
  STATUS Landed Venus
  BASE Aphrodite:2
  HEADING 120.00
  GEAR 1 1.0000
  PRPLEVEL 0:0.050 1:1.000
END
END_SHIPS
